SUMMARY:ONES - The Beatles #1 Hits + Dinner (Princess of Wales)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On this Saturday August 1st long weekend
 \,** **join us for ONES - The Beatles # 1 Hits at the Princess of Wales Th
 eatre.** Every once in a long time\, a show comes to remind you why you fe
 ll in love with the music of the Beatles. Cashbox calls it\, “The most e
 xciting Beatles presentation in decades!” ONES the Beatles spectacle tha
 t’s thrilling audiences across North America\, is a chronological master
 piece that tells the seven-year story through amazing performances of ever
 y number one hit. Brilliant stories behind the songs\, stunning on-screen 
 presentation\, 22 top musicians and vocalists\, present the music that cha
 nged everything.\n\n***ONES*** is a commitment to note perfect performance
 s of the number one Beatles songs from the Ed Sullivan Show in 1964 to the
 ir break up in 1970. A cast of top musicians have paid attention to every 
 detail\, including 28 guitars and period correct amplifiers and drums that
  were used on the original Beatles recordings. This incredible music is fr
 amed by captivating multi-media narrations by Toronto radio legend **Al Jo
 ynes**. Join the cast of ***ONES*** for a concert salute to the soundtrack
  of a generation. My seat is Orchestra R35. **Purchase ONES - The Beatles 
 # 1 Hits on Saturday August 1st at 7:30pm.**\n\n**SONG LIST**\nThe full li
 st of # 1 songs being performed is available **[here](https://dpb-web.inst
 antencore.com/program/52273/ones---the-beatles-1-hits/page/310604/song-lis
 t?cid=5203940)**\n\n**COST**\nRegular Cost: $59/ 79/ 95/ 109 + service fee
 s\n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**Ticket Policy**: All sales are final\, 
 no refunds or exchanges.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes confirming if y
 ou will join for dinner before. (Everyone goes on the waitlist until they 
 post their seat number.)**\n* **[Purchase](https://tickets.mirvish.com/one
 s/24164)** **your own ticket and select the August 1st date at 7:30pm (not
  2pm)**\, post your seat number and I will move you to going.\n\nA reminde
 r will be sent the day before with my cell and reminder details where to m
 eet and when.\n\nRSVPs close same day at noon\, as this event was posted w
 ith shorter notice than typical. Cancellations will result in a No Show an
 d impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for Dinner at: 5
 :45pm at Canteen at 330 King St. W.**\n\n**Meet me for the Show at: 7:15pm
  inside the Princess of Wales Theatre at 300 King St. W**\, **on the groun
 d floor** **to the right side of the box office after scanning your ticket
 s.**\n\n**Start: 7:30pm**\n\nLength: 2 hours 15 mins (incl. intermission)\
 n\nAfter: meet at the initial meeting spot to chat about the show. We can 
 head out for a drink nearby\, if there is interest.\n\nEnjoy and please po
 st your comments in the Event after.
