SUMMARY:Virtual REGISTER:  Little Caesar Classic Movie
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: After you RSVP\, you will also nee
 d to Register to receive your link to the event.**\n\nOn **Saturday\, Augu
 st 8th\,** **see Little Caesar\, a classic crime film.** A landmark of ear
 ly gangster cinema\, *Little Caesar* helped define the genre with its grit
 ty atmosphere and unforgettable performance by Edward G. Robinson as the r
 uthless Rico Bandello.\nReleased in 1931\, the film captures the rise-and-
 fall intensity of Prohibition-era crime stories\, with Robinson’s fierce
 \, compact energy turning Rico into one of Hollywood’s first great gangs
 ter icons. For anyone who loves classic crime films\, this is one of the b
 ig ones: lean\, tough\, and powered by the kind of performance that made W
 arner Bros. gangster pictures legendary.\n\n**COST**\nFree\n\n**SIGNING UP
 **\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes\n* **[Register](https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/tfs-pr
 esents-little-caesar-1931-tickets-1992782098902?)** for the film and you w
 ill receive a confirmation email on how to access your zoom link to the ev
 ent\n* **Start time: 7:15pm pre-film talk (click on link provided directly
  to you)**\n* **Movie start time: 7:30pm**\n* Movie length: 1 hour 17 mins
 \n* RSVPs close 1 day prior to start time\, hoping spots are still availab
 le\n*\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
